    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh no!!</i><br>Your sweet and caring grandmama has been kidnapped by the villain &quot;Heimgartner&quot; and his group of thugs! It falls upon your shoulders, as the young golem &quot;Linden&quot;, to go in pursuit and brave a plethora of labyrinthine dungeons to set things right again!<br><br><i>- How can a golem have a grandmother?</i><br><i>- Who are these villains and why are they doing such terrible things?</i><br><i>- And what is the story with that quirky floating skull following you, called &quot;Murray&quot;?</i><br><br>All will be revealed in time.<br>In a game that puts gameplay first, but is rich in world building for those that want it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Zelda-like gameplay with fresh surprises </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A big assortment of large and varied dungeons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-linear level and world design, ripe for sequence breaking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A gripping story with twists and turns </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Secrets hidden everywhere! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Modern conveniences like auto-saves, map markers and button remapping </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Murray!! (You'll all love him instantly, or so he keeps confidently proclaiming)</p></li></ul><br><strong>WISHLIST TODAY</strong>, to be among the first to discover this brand new world of dungeons, secrets and adventure!<br><br>------------------------------------- <br><br><strong>UPDATE\u00a0 August 11th, 2025:</strong><br>I'm constantly making progress on the full game.<br>There are currently already 38 different enemy types completed. More will be added in the coming few weeks.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh no!!</i><br>Your sweet and caring grandmama has been kidnapped by the villain &quot;Heimgartner&quot; and his group of thugs! It falls upon your shoulders, as the young golem &quot;Linden&quot;, to go in pursuit and brave a plethora of labyrinthine dungeons to set things right again!<br><br><i>- How can a golem have a grandmother?</i><br><i>- Who are these villains and why are they doing such terrible things?</i><br><i>- And what is the story with that quirky floating skull following you, called &quot;Murray&quot;?</i><br><br>All will be revealed in time.<br>In a game that puts gameplay first, but is rich in world building for those that want it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Zelda-like gameplay with fresh surprises </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A big assortment of large and varied dungeons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-linear level and world design, ripe for sequence breaking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A gripping story with twists and turns </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Secrets hidden everywhere! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Modern conveniences like auto-saves, map markers and button remapping </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Murray!! (You'll all love him instantly, or so he keeps confidently proclaiming)</p></li></ul><br><strong>WISHLIST TODAY</strong>, to be among the first to discover this brand new world of dungeons, secrets and adventure!<br><br>------------------------------------- <br><br><strong>UPDATE\u00a0 August 11th, 2025:</strong><br>I'm constantly making progress on the full game.<br>There are currently already 38 different enemy types completed. More will be added in the coming few weeks.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a new world of secrets and adventure. Featuring solid 2D Zelda-like gameplay, 12 vast non-linear dungeons and a wholesome story about the young golem protagonist called Linden.",
